# ==============================================================================
# TMX Group - Trivy CVE Suppression / Allowlist Policy (.trivyignore)
# Standard: Zero-Trust DevSecOps Exception Policy
#
# Every suppression entry MUST be documented with:
# 1. The exact CVE identifier (e.g. CVE-2023-XXXXX)
# 2. Technical Justification (e.g. vulnerable code path is unreachable / uncompiled)
# 3. Approving Security Ticket / Architect (e.g. SEC-1042 / Platform Security)
# 4. Mandatory Expiration Date (Exceptions expire after 30-90 days)
# ==============================================================================

# Example Entry:
# CVE-2023-99999
# Justification: Unused cryptographic cipher in optional utility; unreachable by application runtime.
# Approved-By: Kyle Pryce-Jones (SEC-8921)
# Expiry: 2026-12-31
